# A new conversation's sidebar row takes the title its provider gives it as
# soon as the provider has it, without a refresh, and keeps that title when
# the app starts again. The fixture's Codex names each conversation
# "Simulator conversation" when it creates it.
expect "検証プロジェクト" 30000
press このプロジェクトで新しいチャット
type "AI に依頼する" "[immediate] 題名を確かめます"
press 送信
expect "シミュレータで完了しました。" 30000
press 検証プロジェクト
expect "Simulator conversation" 10000
screenshot live-title
# The unfolded project is kept once the list's copy has been written.
wait 12000
relaunch
expect "検証プロジェクト" 30000
expect "Simulator conversation" 20000
screenshot relaunched-title
